# The pad's menu keys, which hold only while the menus are up and the pad has their cursor: Back and B are Escape,
# Start is Enter, A is Enter (a left click when the cursor shown is on a control), the D-pad is the arrow keys and an
# arrow the focused control does not use moves the focus as Tab does (down and right to the next control, up and
# left to the previous one). In play the buttons are their Joy keys and their bindings (DefUser.ini: Back shows the
# scores, Start opens the menus). Start a map, e.g. 'DM-Deck16][?Game=Botpack.DeathMatchPlus'.
waitlog up for play
sleep 3
pad attach
sleep 1
pad button a 1
pad button a 0
pad button b 1
pad button b 0
pad button dpup 1
pad button dpup 0
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 0.5
probe play
# Start's binding opens the menus with the Game menu dropped down; the mouse then takes the cursor out of the way.
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 1
probe menus
mouse 400 400
sleep 0.3
probe mouse-has-it
# A press takes the cursor back and acts: Right twice goes to Options, Down to Preferences, and A, with the cursor
# on no control, is Enter and runs it.
pad button dpright 1
pad button dpright 0
sleep 0.3
probe right-1
pad button dpright 1
pad button dpright 0
sleep 0.3
probe right-2
pad button dpdown 1
pad button dpdown 0
sleep 0.3
probe down
pad button a 1
pad button a 0
sleep 1
probe a-enter
# In the Preferences window the D-pad's down and up move the focus from control to control.
pad button dpdown 1
pad button dpdown 0
sleep 0.3
probe focus-1
pad button dpdown 1
pad button dpdown 0
sleep 0.3
probe focus-2
pad button dpdown 1
pad button dpdown 0
sleep 0.3
probe focus-3
pad button dpup 1
pad button dpup 0
sleep 0.3
probe focus-back
# B closes the window, Back the menus.
pad button b 1
pad button b 0
sleep 0.5
probe b
pad button back 1
pad button back 0
sleep 1
probe back
# A with the cursor shown on a control clicks it: the cursor on Options in the menu bar drops its menu down.
pad button start 1
pad button start 0
sleep 1
mouse 100 5
sleep 0.2
pad axis leftx 6000
sleep 0.05
pad axis leftx 0
sleep 0.3
pad button a 1
pad button a 0
sleep 0.5
probe a-click
